{"sourceUrl":"https://agronomy.swu.edu.cn/info/1064/6576.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:26.430441+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://agronomy.swu.edu.cn/info/1064/6576.htm","html":"<div><div>\n\n\n<div>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>西南大学热忱欢迎全国优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免（初）试攻读我校硕士研究生！为做好接收</span>2027<span>年优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免（初）试攻读研究生（以下简称推免生）工作，我院将开展接收推免生预报名工作，欢迎广大推免生报名！</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）具有推免资格的本科培养单位推荐的、具有免（初）试攻读研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力倾向。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（四）诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（五）身心健康，符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>专业</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>我院在</span></span><span><span>“</span><span>西南大学</span><span>2027</span><span>年接收推免生预报名系统</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span>http://swu.yjszsw.cn/tm/</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>可选报的</span></span><span><span>全日制硕士招生专业均可接收硕士推免生</span></span><span><span>；</span></span><span><span>最终以</span><span>“</span><span>教育部推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>填报专业为准</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名和复试</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>程序</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>一</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名程序</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span>. </span><span><span>报名时间：</span></span><span>2026<span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>8</span><span>日至</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>16</span><span>（</span><span>17:00</span><span>前）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span>.</span><span> </span><span><span>凡符合上述</span></span><span><span>报名</span></span><span><span>条件且有意愿报考我校的优秀应届本科毕业生（包括本校和外校），请于报名时间内登录</span><span>“</span><span>西南大学</span></span><span>2027</span><span><span>年接收推免生预报名系统</span><span>”</span><span>（</span><span>http://swu.yjszsw.cn/tm/</span><span>），</span></span><span><span>按要求上传相关材料</span></span><span><span>并</span></span><span><span>完成报名信息</span></span><span><span>提交</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>报名所需提交相关材料如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（1） </span></span><span><span>本人学生证</span></span><span><span>扫描件</span></span><span><span>（复试提供原件）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（2） </span></span><span><span>第二代身份证正反面</span></span><span><span>扫描件</span></span><span><span>（复试提供原件）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（3） </span></span><span><span>加盖本科学校教务处公章的</span><span>“</span><span>在校历年学习成绩表</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>扫面件（</span></span><span><span>复试提供原件</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（4） </span></span><span><span>本人详细简历（包括本科专业背景、学习科研情况等）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（5） </span></span><span><span>所在高校的推免资格证明（如所在学校尚未公示推免资格，可暂不提交，在推免复试前补交）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（6） </span></span><span><span>（如果有）国家英语四、六级证书或成绩单（复试提供原件）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（7） </span></span><span><span>（如果有）代表性学术成果（复试提供原件）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（8） </span></span><span><span>（如果有）获奖证书或专利证书（复试提供原件）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>要求：上传文件按照顺序扫描或合并成</span>1<span>个</span><span>pdf</span><span>文件且大小不要超过</span><span>8M</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>二</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>复试安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>学院</span></span><span><span>将对</span></span><span><span>考生</span></span><span><span>提交的所有材料进行审查</span></span><span><span>，择优确定</span></span><span><span>复试名单并发出通知，请考生及时关注</span></span><span><span>“</span><span>西南大学</span></span><span>2027</span><span><span>年接收推免生预报名系统</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>站内消息并保持手机畅通。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1. </span></span><span><span>报到时间和地点</span></span></p>\n<p><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span></span><span>19</span><span><span>日</span></span><span>8</span><span><span>：</span></span><span>3</span><span>0</span><span>~17<span>：</span><span>00</span><span>，</span><span>37</span><span>教学楼</span><span>207</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2. </span></span><span><span>复试时间</span></span></p>\n<p><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span><span>20</span><span>日</span></span><span>8</span><span><span>：</span></span><span>3</span><span>0<span>开始，请提前</span><span>30</span><span>分钟到达候考室；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3. </span></span><span><span>复试方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>线下复试；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4. </span></span><span><span>复试地点</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>候考室：</span></span><span><span>隆平楼</span>205</span><span><span>，</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试考场：</span></span><span><span>隆平楼</span>202</span><span><span>、</span></span><span>203</span><span><span>、</span></span><span>206<span>和</span><span>209</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5. </span></span><span><span>复试内容</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试内容包括思想道德水平考核、外语水平测试</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span>2<span>分钟英文自我介绍</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>、专业素养考核、科研潜力、综合素质考核、心理健康状态检查等内容，满分为</span>100<span>分。复试分数低于</span><span>60</span><span>分为不合格。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、其他事项</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）</span></span><span><span>申请人提交的全部材料必须保证真实准确，若弄虚作假，一经发现，立即取消其接收推免申请资格</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>已在我校</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>西南大学</span></span><span>2027</span><span><span>年接收推免生预报名系统</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>预</span></span><span><span>报名的</span></span><span><span>考生</span></span><span><span>届时还</span></span><span><span>应</span></span><span><span>通过教育部</span><span>“</span><span>全国推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>注册并填报志愿，</span></span><span><span>并在学院规定时间内</span></span><span><span>按工作程序完成招生流程</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>具体流程包括：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1. <span>通过预推免复试的推免生在推免系统开通后登录中国研招网</span><span>“</span><span>全国推免生服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>填报志愿；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2. <span>学院通过中国研招网</span><span>“</span><span>全国推免生服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>发复试通知，推免生接收复试通知；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span>.</span><span> </span><span><span>学院通过研招网发待录取通知，推免生接收待录取。推免生接收工作结束。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>“</span><span>全国推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>网址为：</span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/<span>，预计</span>9<span>月下旬开放报名，请申请人关注中国研究生招生信息网和</span></span><span><span>学院官网</span></span><span><span>通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>我校将根据教育部</span></span><span><span>的</span></span><span><span>最新推免政策</span></span><span><span>和学校相关文件要求</span></span><span><span>及时公布</span></span><span><span>西南</span></span><span><span>大学</span></span><span>2027</span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>接收推免生章程</span></span><span><span>及其他相关信息，</span></span><span><span>请</span></span><span><span>关注</span></span><span><span>西南大学研招网和学院官网</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（五）未进行预报名的考生，也可在</span><span>“</span><span>研招网推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>开通后进行报名。我院将根据接收指标剩余情况决定是否发放复试通知和组织复试，具体安排以实时通知为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五、接收推免工作联系方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：李老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span>023-68250409<span>，邮箱：</span><span>swunsyz@163.com</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系地址：西南大学</span></span><span><span>老期刊社</span>208</span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>                                        </span></p>\n<p><span>2026<span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>7</span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>附件：西南大学</span>2027<span>年接收推免生预报名系统操作步骤（考生端）</span></span></p>\n</div>\n\n</div></div>","textSha256":"e8c86579230531b6b30f69386a2d4148aa8fe0b9cf936c8755e96a55eb8ab166","textLength":1704,"sourceSha256":"0dd9e689f8598c5b4b7f0e3598a233cca922cf282f211902da669bbc981e2293","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件.西南大学2027年接收推免生预报名系统操作步骤（考生端）.docx","url":"https://agronomy.swu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1747817290&wbfileid=A2E596E2D901DA0703C2B2722AAD576F"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d7079371e54ceb815c34","title":"2026年西南大学农学与生物科技学院关于接收2027年优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免（初）试攻读研究生的预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:26.430441+00:00"}
